### Start or Get Conversation
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat/conversations
Content-Type: application/json
x-client-id: {{clientId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{memberAccessToken}}

{
  "trainerUserId": "{{trainerUserId}}"
}

### Send Text Message
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat/conversations/{{conversationId}}/messages
Content-Type: application/json
x-client-id: {{clientId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "messageType": "TEXT",
  "text": "Hello, are you available tomorrow?"
}

### Upload and Send Image Message
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat/conversations/{{conversationId}}/messages/image
x-client-id: {{clientId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=ChatImageBoundary

--ChatImageBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="image"; filename="chat-image.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./files/chat-image.jpg
--ChatImageBoundary--

### List Messages
GET {{baseUrl}}/chat/conversations/{{conversationId}}/messages
Content-Type: application/json
x-client-id: {{clientId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
